{
  "_comment": "Pins the negative half of the Passed arm (RFC-MACP-0007 Section 6.2), which no fixture exercised before: every earlier negative-commitment fixture had a Failed or NoVotes tally. Its twin decision_decline_over_approval_allowed.json differs only in commitment.allow_decline_over_approval.",
  "description": "Decision Mode: a Passed vote denies a negative commitment by default, even when the decline guard is satisfied.",
  "mode": "macp.mode.decision.v1",
  "initiator": "agent://orchestrator",
  "participants": [
    "agent://orchestrator",
    "agent://a",
    "agent://b",
    "agent://c"
  ],
  "mode_version": "1.0.0",
  "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
  "policy": {
    "policy_id": "policy.decision.decline-over-approval",
    "mode": "macp.mode.decision.v1",
    "schema_version": 3,
    "description": "Majority vote, initiator-only commitment, allow_decline_over_approval false.",
    "rules": {
      "voting": {
        "algorithm": "majority"
      },
      "commitment": {
        "authority": "initiator_only",
        "allow_decline_over_approval": false
      }
    }
  },
  "policy_version": "policy.decision.decline-over-approval",
  "ttl_ms": 60000,
  "messages": [
    {
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Proposal",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.ProposalPayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "option": "deploy",
        "rationale": "ready",
        "supporting_data": []
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://a",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://b",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "One decisive REJECT, so the decline guard's reject_count > 0 conjunct holds, and require_vote_quorum is unset. The tally is 2 APPROVE / 1 REJECT = 0.667 >= 0.5, so the result is Passed. The only remaining ground for denying a negative commitment is the Passed arm of RFC-MACP-0007 Section 6.2, which is what this pair of fixtures isolates.",
      "sender": "agent://c",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "REJECT",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "THE DISCRIMINATOR. RFC-MACP-0007 Section 6.2, Passed: a negative commitment is denied unless commitment.allow_decline_over_approval is true. It is false here (the default, made explicit). The decline guard is satisfied, so a runtime that applies only the guard to a Passed tally accepts this message and fails the fixture. Mode validation passes: a proposal exists and the sender is the initiator, so POLICY_DENIED is the only producible code.",
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c1",
        "outcome_positive": false,
        "action": "decision.rejected",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "commit",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.decision.decline-over-approval",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "POLICY_DENIED"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Passed authorizes the positive direction.",
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c2",
        "outcome_positive": true,
        "action": "decision.selected",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "commit",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.decision.decline-over-approval",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    }
  ],
  "expected_final_state": "Resolved",
  "expect_resolution_present": true,
  "expected_resolution": {
    "action": "decision.selected",
    "mode_version": "1.0.0",
    "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
    "outcome_positive": true
  },
  "expected_mode_state": {
    "phase": "Committed",
    "votes": {
      "p1": {
        "agent://a": {
          "vote": "APPROVE"
        },
        "agent://b": {
          "vote": "APPROVE"
        },
        "agent://c": {
          "vote": "REJECT"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
